WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.957 --> 00:00:12.122
Open the sign-in page and enter your email and password.

2
00:00:13.434 --> 00:00:19.955
After signing in you land on the dashboard: today's sales, stock alerts and recent activity at a glance.

3
00:00:20.055 --> 00:00:24.044
Scroll down for charts, best sellers and the latest sales.

4
00:00:25.186 --> 00:00:29.891
Everything you need is in the menu on the left, grouped by what you do.

5
00:00:29.991 --> 00:00:36.566
Sales has the POS terminal where your cashiers ring up customers, plus sales history, refunds and shifts.

6
00:00:38.467 --> 00:00:45.152
Inventory is your catalogue and stock: products, categories, brands and live stock levels for every branch.

7
00:00:46.453 --> 00:00:50.829
Stock levels show what is on every shelf and what is running low.

8
00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:57.387
People holds your customers, your team and the roles that decide who can do what.

9
00:00:58.888 --> 00:01:04.310
Reports turn your sales into answers: takings, payments, profit and what to reorder.

10
00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:11.960
Settings is where you set your business name, currency, tax, receipts and everything else.

11
00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:19.260
That is the whole product. The next tutorials go through each area step by step.
